4C9.29615 41.7534 9.0121 41.549 8.96714 41.2537C8.92218 40.9574 9.12653 40.6734 9.42182 40.6284C18.443 39.1734 27.5898 39.1734 36.612 40.6284C36.9073 40.6734 37.1116 40.9574 37.0667 41.2537C37.0207 41.5265 36.7938 41.7197 36.521 41.7197Z&#x27; fill=&#x27;white&#x27;/%3e %3c/svg%3e" class="r-1jvuxt1" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="ad6e8785-7d90-4545-b37a-ed1f5523af79" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1g3exl9 alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>Culinary Versatility</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="21cf76fb-0828-4568-81b1-300df3a6002d" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1k7wse2 alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p>Peruvian Scallops are incredibly versatile in the kitchen, thriving in both simple and elaborate preparations. Whether seared, grilled, baked, or enjoyed raw in dishes like ceviche, these scallops maintain their tender texture and sweet flavor. Chefs appreciate their adaptability, often incorporating them into a range of dishes, from light, citrusy appetizers to more indulgent creations like scallop risotto. Their naturally lean meat allows them to cook quickly while staying succulent, making them a favorite choice for both casual and gourmet meals.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="ca5b4bd9-49d1-4c86-9011-e93c5447dca2" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-7eeovv"><picture data-rid="472e4046-f0bc-46af-bd7f-38c7167a636c" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1p6f3rr"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Frame_1_107821e0-fb33-436c-a230-2144fc573148.png?v=1722611000&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Frame_1_107821e0-fb33-436c-a230-2144fc573148.png?v=1722611000&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 820px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Frame_1_107821e0-fb33-436c-a230-2144fc573148.png?v=1722611000&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 821px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Frame_1_107821e0-fb33-436c-a230-2144fc573148.png?v=1722611000&amp;width=2048" media="(min-width: 1025px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Frame_1_107821e0-fb33-436c-a230-2144fc573148.png?v=1722611000" alt="A stylized leaf icon on a white background." class="r-1i0lde0" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="65b8c476-ec75-45fa-b29a-eb50338ec936" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1ifo36w alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>History & Origin</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="98f12569-6a5f-453f-8b41-e76e91cc9f63" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-79zehd alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p>Peruvian Scallops are native to the cold, nutrient-rich waters off the coast of Peru, thriving in the Humboldt Current, which provides the ideal environment for their growth. Unlike other scallop varieties, Peruvian Scallops are farmed in suspended cages in the ocean, allowing them to develop their signature sweet, tender meat. These sustainable farming practices, combined with the natural conditions of their habitat, result in scallops with a clean, briny flavor and a soft texture. Their oceanic environment plays a key role in shaping the delicate taste and unique quality of Peruvian Scallops.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="db02ba37-3a1a-4981-a5e6-d435331fce1f" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0" class="r-dbhag0"><div data-rid="58393a73-f06d-4c95-8af5-ea899ea71ec9" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" class="r-i5wzu7"><div data-rid="a6a18ec0-9990-4031-bebc-662be0d996cd" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-m97jga alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p>How Seatopia delivers certified peruvian scallops</p></span></div><div data-rid="8850c740-230f-4bc8-8c5a-e0c74c342f44" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-wa5fle alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p>We work with artisan farms around the world to source the best peruvian scallops for you. Our farms are small-scale, and the fish are raised in low-density, antibiotic-free conditions, and fed micro-algae-based oils.</p></span></div><div data-rid="de1d20e6-31f7-429c-a4d6-381eb4865fab" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-10d29q6"><div data-rid="ac129798-b452-4a6f-b0ba-b2ab2d6af673" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-c9b3af"><div data-rid="58cea6a1-8974-43a5-b365-629fa384c4f5" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-85rrb0 alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p>Clean feed and clean water makes for clean fish. Seatopia peruvian scallops:</p></span></div><div data-rid="26c7b618-f5e4-4865-99af-eae28a5e2aae" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-17y9dvc"><div data-rid="cf0cc353-dc13-42a7-a975-f8d1635d6da0" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1dcj9at"><picture data-rid="d076202b-6113-4399-b3a6-51b4942fb9d6" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-192gygr"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg width=&#x27;20&#x27; height=&#x27;20&#x27; viewBox=&#x27;0 0 20 20&#x27; fill=&#x27;none&#x27; xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%3e %3ccircle cx=&#x27;10&#x27; cy=&#x27;10&#x27; r=&#x27;10&#x27; fill=&#x27;%23E1DBCF&#x27;/%3e %3cpath d=&#x27;M5.84375 5.83313L14.1771 14.1665&#x27; stroke=&#x27;%231A3059&#x27; stroke-width=&#x27;1.66667&#x27;/%3e %3cpath d=&#x27;M14.1562 5.83313L5.82292 14.1665&#x27; stroke=&#x27;%231A3059&#x27; stroke-width=&#x27;1.66667&#x27;/%3e %3c/svg%3e" class="r-v2zhfg" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="57a44e1d-797d-4ba9-92e7-c105401c75d9" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1izge0c alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p>Contains zero detectable microplastics</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="dec7679d-ee70-42ea-9cfe-9ad07e7560de" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-hxqmf3 alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p>We send samples of our fish to lab partners who ensure it is free from any detectable microplastics.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="bf039351-8741-4af2-8bfd-7237fc2def04" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-m6axvj"><div data-rid="c842f502-99a6-4457-8b70-06a9a9d9326b" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1h1uwh"><picture data-rid="aa95c23f-5b05-4a5f-86f6-776b1a63175e" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-14n9oec"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg width=&#x27;20&#x27; height=&#x27;20&#x27; viewBox=&#x27;0 0 20 20&#x27; fill=&#x27;none&#x27; xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%3e %3ccircle cx=&#x27;10&#x27; cy=&#x27;10&#x27; r=&#x27;10&#x27; fill=&#x27;%23E1DBCF&#x27;/%3e %3cpath d=&#x27;M5.84375 5.83313L14.1771 14.1665&#x27; stroke=&#x27;%231A3059&#x27; stroke-width=&#x27;1.66667&#x27;/%3e %3cpath d=&#x27;M14.1562 5.83313L5.82292 14.1665&#x27; stroke=&#x27;%231A3059&#x27; stroke-width=&#x27;1.66667&#x27;/%3e %3c/svg%3e" class="r-1a5eju6" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="91b11a48-c2c9-460e-bb90-7ed8d2b97592" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-bc3prr alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p>Is mercury free</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="13af35e7-8ad9-4d0a-8bd8-bb21e5e288ef" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-cjeizb alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p>We also test for mercury to ensure our fish contains less than .01 PPM of mercury which means it's safe to eat.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="b818f852-ea50-42b1-8211-9ca6167bf78c" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1g4iix8"><div data-rid="16ae916c-1636-4534-a6a1-9cc0c66d6e85" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-awso"><picture 